license: MIT
keywords:
  - systematic-literature-review
  - prisma-2020
  - citation-snowballing
  - bibliometrics
  - peft
  - nlp
abstract: >-
  Automated SLR engine implementing citation snowballing (Wohlin 2014) with a
  PRISMA 2020-compatible audit trail, applied to PEFT and modular adapter
  methods for transformer-based NLP models. This public release ships code,
  configs, schemas, open evidence tables and safety tooling, and deliberately
  withholds licensed bibliographic content.
